8	match	5	1	2026-09-07 12:50:34.235689-05	TPL 2017/18 (edition 1) vs en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2017-18_Tanzanian_Premier_League. Wikipedia final table verified internally consistent (480 played, GF=GA=470, W=L). Per-team W, L, GF and GA match the vault EXACTLY for all 16 clubs; only draws differ, by exactly the number of matches each club has with a NULL score. All 42 such matches carry zero goal events. Conclusion: the legacy migration lost 0-0 draws, recording the score as NULL rather than 0.
67	match_event	15	16	2026-09-12 16:28:45.388363-05	TPL 2023/24-2025/26 own goals from ligikuu.co.tz filed under the benefiting team. 19 corrected on the stored score (agreed by ligikuu and whoscored, run 23), 1 (match 17991) on the scorer's club spell. Side-effect one-day spells at the benefiting club deleted.
11	match	6	1	2026-09-07 14:51:00.249669-05	TPL 2017/18 (edition 1) match-by-match vs rsssf.org/tablest/tanz2018.html. Parsed 240 matches over 30 rounds; reference verified self-consistent (16 teams x 30 appearances, 470 goals, 42 goalless draws). Result: all 240 scores and all 240 kickoff dates identical to the vault. ZERO disagreements. This independently confirms the 42 0-0 draws recovered in run 8 were correct at match level, not merely in aggregate. RSSSF carries no goalscorers, so the 42 unattributed goals remain unresolved.
69	player	1	6	2026-09-15 23:27:57.424474-05	Samuel Eto'o held as two players: legacy "Etoo" (7174) and "Samuel Eto'o" (7263). Merged into 7263, which the RSSSF 1957-2000 load also matched on. 2 events and 1 provenance row moved.
14	match	6	1	2026-09-07 15:42:33.701667-05	TPL 2018/19 (edition 6) match-by-match vs rsssf.org/tablest/tanz2019.html. RSSSF results verified to reproduce RSSSF's own final table exactly, which is itself identical to Wikipedia's. Joined on date + unordered team pair, because orientation was one of the things in doubt. Findings across 380 matches: 314 already correct; 61 missing a score (60 of them 0-0, the same defect as 2017/18); 6 with home and away REVERSED (results consistent, venue wrong); 0 genuine score conflicts. Applying fills and swaps reproduces the official table exactly for all 20 clubs.
16	match	6	1	2026-09-07 16:39:17.945328-05	TPL 2019/20 (edition 17) vs rsssf.org/tablest/tanz2020.html. RSSSF's 380 results reproduce the Wikipedia final table exactly for all 20 clubs, so it is authoritative here. The season was COMPLETED (resumed after COVID, finished 26 Jul 2020) — it was not curtailed. Our legacy data stops at 15 Mar 2020, so the post-resumption fixtures were never captured. Plan: create 31 absent matches (mostly rounds 31-38), fill 93 missing scores, swap 2 reversed fixtures, correct 3 wrong scores, delete 3 empty phantom SCHEDULED rows, and VOID match 1252 — a third fixture for a pair whose both legs we already hold, crediting 2 goals to a player who had transferred away a month earlier. 1252 is set to CANCELLED with no score rather than deleted, so its 3 events survive for review.
72	match_event	6	6	2026-09-15 23:52:33.767781-05	Zambia 2-2 Senegal, AFCON 2000 (match 22357): RSSSF wrote the scorer brackets in the opposite order to the fixture, so all four goals were credited to the wrong team. Re-sided by the scorers' nationalities. Score unchanged. Found by auditing every pre-2002 score draw, the only shape in which a side-swap survives the loader's per-side check.
73	player	1	16	2026-09-15 23:52:33.767781-05	Africa Cup of Nations scorer identities: 45 duplicate player records merged into 39 survivors. Two causes -- WhoScored short names keyed as name:{team}:{name} before player ids were available, and legacy SokaFC full names against WhoScored common names for AFCON 2019. Ten merges are confirmed by matching the published all-time total exactly. No goal event is created or deleted; only player_id changes.
23	match	15	16	2026-09-08 06:06:40.027109-05	TPL 2020/21-2026/27, ligikuu.co.tz (official, SportsPress REST API) against whoscored.com. Fixtures joined on (season, canonical home, canonical away). The official site wins where both carry a value; every disagreement is recorded here rather than resolved silently.
77	team	1	16	2026-09-16 16:15:02.269716-05	Taifa Stars (team 23) and Tanzania (team 91) are one national side under two records: same country, never opponents, never in the same edition. Merged into 91. 11 matches, 13 events and 4 spells moved. Detected by the audit check SCORER_TWO_NATIONS, which found Simon Msuva scoring for both.
