38	match	1	16	2026-09-12 00:38:55.999912-05	AFCON 2019 (edition 14), the migrated legacy copy against whoscored.com. Joined on date plus unordered team pair. The vault is source A and is left untouched; every disagreement is recorded here rather than resolved (principle 2). Note for whoever resolves these: 16 of this edition's matches have a stored score that disagrees with the edition's own match_events, and in those cases the event log is what agrees with WhoScored -- so the stored score, not the event log, is the thing in doubt. Three separate defects are mixed together here: group matches whose away score is inflated, knockout ties where the shootout winner was credited an extra goal, and matches left NULL that were 0-0 (the same lost-goalless-draw defect found in TPL 2017/18, run 8).
